tests: TestTwoCallsPastTheHardCapAreNotIssuedInOneSecond TestAFutureStampCountsForOneSecondFromTheRequestThatSeesIt TestAStoredInstantAheadOfTheClockKeepsTheWindow
scheduled-count: no

